  {
    "description": "Store a relationship stated by the owner as a constraint, maintained automatically on later edits. Supported: align (targets: several parallel walls, kept collinear); center (targets: [opening, space]; the opening is centred on that space's segment of the wall); spacing (targets: [opening or wall, wall], params.distance in mm: clear distance from the opening edge to the wall face, or centre-to-centre distance of two parallel walls); size-target (targets: [space, optional wall], params.area in m², params.tolerance default 0.3). With hard=true, violating operations are rejected. source: user if the owner said it, agent if you inferred it.",
    "examples": [
      {
        "input": {
          "note": "门在房间中线上",
          "targets": [
            "主卧南墙·门",
            "主卧",
          ],
          "type": "center",
        },
        "note": "Centre a door",
      },
      {
        "input": {
          "note": "老人房一约 12 平",
          "params": {
            "area": 12,
          },
          "targets": [
            "老人房一",
          ],
          "type": "size-target",
        },
        "note": "Area target",
      },
    ],
    "input": {
      "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
      "properties": {
        "hard": {
          "default": false,
          "type": "boolean",
        },
        "note": {
          "description": "Record in the owner's own words",
          "type": "string",
        },
        "params": {
          "additionalProperties": {},
          "default": {},
          "propertyNames": {
            "type": "string",
          },
          "type": "object",
        },
        "source": {
          "default": "user",
          "enum": [
            "user",
            "agent",
            "default",
          ],
          "type": "string",
        },
        "targets": {
          "description": "Object IDs or names",
          "items": {
            "type": "string",
          },
          "minItems": 1,
          "type": "array",
        },
        "type": {
          "enum": [
            "align",
            "center",
            "spacing",
            "size-target",
          ],
          "type": "string",
        },
      },
      "required": [
        "type",
        "targets",
      ],
      "type": "object",
    },
    "kind": "relation",
